## 3. Dataset Provenance & Attribution Declaration

- **Dataset Provenance:** All 382 question-answer examples in `data/raw/python_qa_raw.jsonl` were authored directly by the project contributors for this educational assignment, referencing standard syntax definitions from the official Python 3.10 documentation (`docs.python.org`).
- **External Material:** No proprietary datasets, web-scraped forums, or third-party copyrighted QA banks were used.
- **Model Attribution:** Pretrained base model weights (`Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct`) are developed by the Qwen Team / Alibaba Cloud and distributed under the **Apache-2.0 License**.
